 "url": "https://pavelaleks.github.io/core_landing/app/",
 "citeAs": "Nurmatova, Aigerim; Begadilova, Tolkyn; Ramazanova, Bakyt (2026). Data and R code for: Clinical severity and in-hospital outcomes across pre-VOC, Alpha-dominant, and Delta-dominant SARS-CoV-2 periods in Almaty, Kazakhstan: a retrospective cohort study. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23608062",
 "isBasedOn": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23608062",
